7. Gold Plus: Investment sweep feature explained
   ID: doc_savings_accounts_gold_plus_account_003
   Score: 9.3475
   Content: ## Availability and threshold

- Feature availability: Yes
- Sweep threshold: $50,000

### How sweeps work

