content: Thanks for reaching out, Marcus — happy to help you sort this out.

I checked our current promotional offers, and I'm not able to locate any offer matching a **$1,000 statement credit for spending $10,000 in the first 2 months**. That specific offer isn't in our system right now, so I unfortunately can't set it up or honor it.

Here's what is currently active (as of today, November 14, 2025) for new customers:

- **Silver Rewards Card — $500 statement credit signup bonus:** Earn a $500 statement credit when you spend $2,000 within the first 1 month after account opening. Account must stay open and in good standing through the bonus fulfillment date.
- **EcoCard — bonus sustainability points:** Runs 2025-08-01 through 2025-12-15. $5.00 points per dollar at qualifying green merchants, $1.00 per dollar on everything else (some retailer categories are excluded).
- **Platinum Rewards Card — first year annual fee waived:** $0 instead of the standard $200 for the first 12 months from account opening.
- **Silver Zoom Card — triple cash back promo:** Claim window 2024-01-01 through 2025-12-31; account must be open and in good standing.
- Business cards (if either of those flyers was for a business): **Business Bronze Rewards Card** promo runs 2025-10-01 through 2026-03-31, and **Business Platinum Rewards Card** has a first-year annual fee waiver with a window of 2025-11-01 through 2026-02-28.

Could you tell me the **card name printed on the flyer**? If you can share it, I'll pull up that exact product and confirm what promotion is actually attached to it right now. I can also walk you through the details of any of the offers above or help you get an application started — just let me know which one you'd like to look at.
